@host = http://localhost:9090/api
@uri = {{host}}/servicios-incluidos
@token = PEGAR_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN

### Listar servicios incluidos
GET {{uri}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Insertar con JSON inválido (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Familiar incluye Aire acondicionado
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "tipo_habitacion_id": 3,
    "servicio_habitacion_id": 2
}

### Insertar con ids en 0 (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "tipo_habitacion_id": 0,
    "servicio_habitacion_id": 0
}

### Insertar con ids no numéricos (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "tipo_habitacion_id": "suite",
    "servicio_habitacion_id": "wifi"
}

### Insertar pareja repetida (409 desde datos)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "tipo_habitacion_id": 2,
    "servicio_habitacion_id": 3
}

###
